      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "Learned Advocate General submits that in present matter to initiate the process to acquire the land of the petitioner in terms of order passed by the Court is at final stage and file is pending for approval of concerned Secretary to start the process by issuing Notification under Section 11 of the Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013.",
