          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 781,
          "end": 887
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "He has further submitted that though Engineer-in-Chief was present in person in the Court today, however, due to some urgent official work he has to leave the Court premises and further that needful will be done within ten days.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 889,
      "end": 1117,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Considering the submissions of learned Advocate General, matter is adjourned for consideration with direction that in case of failure in taking steps by issuing appropriate Notification in compliance of order passed by the court, concerned Secretary, Engineer-in-Chief and other Officers shall remain present in person alongwith record to assist the Court .\nwith respect to steps taken by them in compliance of order passed by the Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1118,
      "end": 1556,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "It is made clear that in case appropriate steps are not taken, adverse order shall follow.",
